ffff; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. (제1항 제3호)7</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">학기 이상 등록자에 한하여 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">6</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">학점이내 성적</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; MARGIN-TOP: 1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -52.5pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 다. (제1항 제4호)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">졸업예정자로서 그 성적이 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">‘F“</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">인 과목</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; MARGIN-TOP: 1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -50pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 라. </span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#cc3d3d\">(</font><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#cc3d3d\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">경과조치</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">제</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">166</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">조 제</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">항 제</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">호부터 제</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">4</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">호까지는 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">학년도 이전 이수 교과목에 한하여 </span></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; MARGIN-TOP: 1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -50pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0p