ination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 2015학년도 1학기(2015.03.01.)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">부터 시행</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; MARGIN-TOP: 1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -50pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; MARGIN-TOP: 1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -50pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span>\\</span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; MARGIN-TOP: 1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -50pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"1\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2014. 11. </span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; MARGIN-TOP: 1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -50pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt; mso-pa